sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Caller as 👤 Remote Cellular Caller
    participant Carrier as 📡 Mobile Carrier Network<br/>(Airtel / Jio / Vi VoLTE)
    participant Modem as 📱 Handset Baseband Modem<br/>(iQOO Z9 MT6878 Modem)
    participant AOSP as ⚙️ Android Telecom & Audio HAL<br/>(InCallService & AudioFlinger)
    participant App as 📲 AI_CALL Android App<br/>(CallManager & UI)
    participant BT_Bridge as 📻 External Bluetooth HFP Bridge<br/>(ESP32 / Linux Hands-Free Client)
    participant PC_AI as 🖥️ Host PC Local AI Pipeline<br/>(Whisper + Ollama + SAPI5 TTS)
    participant Cloud_DID as ⚠️ Commercial Cloud Telephony DID<br/>(Exotel / Twilio — PAID ONLY)

    Note over Caller,PC_AI: AI_CALL Phase 9 — Verified Architecture & Telephony Audio Flow

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 1. INCOMING CELLULAR CALL SIGNALING
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    Note over Caller,App: 1. Cellular Call Signaling
    Caller->>Carrier: Dials User Primary Mobile Number
    Carrier->>Modem: Cellular Paging / VoLTE Setup
    Modem->>AOSP: Telecom Framework triggers incoming call event
    AOSP->>App: InCallService receives active incoming call
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 2. UNAVAILABLE / BLOCKED ON-DEVICE AUDIO PATHS
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
    Note over App,AOSP: 2. Blocked On-Device Software Audio Paths
    opt Attempted Software Audio Route (AI_CALL Current Failure)
        App--xModem: [BLOCKED BY ANDROID OS] No public API exists to inject software TTS into Modem Uplink!
        AOSP--xApp: [BLOCKED BY OS SECURITY] VOICE_DOWNLINK requires signature-level CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT!
        Note over App,Modem: Result: TTS plays into room speaker; remote caller hears dead silence.
    end
    opt Attempted Direct Carrier SIP Forwarding
        Carrier--xPC_AI: [UNSUPPORTED BY CARRIERS] Mobile carriers strictly reject forwarding to SIP URIs or private IPs!
    end
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 3. RECOMMENDED PATH: BLUETOOTH HFP AUDIO LOOPBACK (PATH A)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(240, 255, 245)
    Note over Modem,PC_AI: 3. Recommended Architecture: Bluetooth HFP Client Bridge (100% Offline & Free)
    App->>AOSP: Answers call & sets audio route to Bluetooth SCO (ROUTE_BLUETOOTH)
    Modem->>BT_Bridge: Streams digital caller audio over Bluetooth SCO downlink
    BT_Bridge->>PC_AI: Forwards raw PCM audio chunks over USB / Wi-Fi (<15ms)
    
    Note over PC_AI: Local PC AI Engine (Zero Cost, 100% English):<br/>1. English ASR: Transcribes caller speech (~300ms)<br/>2. Guardrail: Regex/Unicode Telugu rejection (<1ms)<br/>3. Reasoning: Ollama qwen2.5:3b response (~1.5s)<br/>4. English TTS: SAPI5 David speech synthesis (~130ms)

    PC_AI->>BT_Bridge: Returns synthesized English PCM speech buffer
    BT_Bridge->>Modem: Injects PCM audio into Bluetooth SCO microphone uplink
    Modem->>Carrier: Baseband modem transmits Bluetooth mic stream over VoLTE
    Carrier->>Caller: Caller hears natural English AI assistant voice
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% 4. ALTERNATE PATH: COMMERCIAL CARRIER CCF TO CLOUD DID (PATH B)
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    rect rgb(255, 250, 235)
    Note over Carrier,Cloud_DID: 4. Alternate Path: Commercial Cloud Forwarding (Paid Telephony / Equal AI Model)
    opt When Using Commercial Cloud Telephony DID ($10-$25/month)
        App->>AOSP: CallScreeningService rejects call (disallow=true, reject=true)
        AOSP->>Carrier: Sends User-Busy signal to cell tower
        Carrier->>Cloud_DID: Executes *67* Forwarding Rule to virtual E.164 DID
        Cloud_DID->>PC_AI: Bridges SIP/RTP audio stream over public Internet
        Note over Cloud_DID,PC_AI: Proven by Equal AI, but requires paid cloud subscription & continuous Internet.
    end
    end
